  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed annexe, by virtue of its siting, massing, design, and close proximity to the common boundary with No.1 Dee Way would appear as an overbearing and overshadowing development which is visual intrusion. The proposed annexe would therefore be detrimental to the amenity that No.1 can reasonably expect to enjoy and is contrary to Policy 7 of the Havering Local Plan (2021) and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
